resume.md
handoff.md
node_modules/
.worktrees/
# .omo/ is otherwise-ignored scratch state, EXCEPT the three files below, which
# are deliberately tracked, load-bearing fixture content, not disposable
# handoff/resume artifacts: docs/examples/p5-passes.json (the bundled
# prosecution example) references them as its provenance transcript/prompt/
# inputs, and packages/prosecute/test/prosecute-cli.test.mjs exercises that
# exact path. They must stay under .omo/evidence/ specifically (not moved
# elsewhere, e.g. docs/examples/) because packages/prosecute/lib/run.mjs's
# isEvidencePath() enforces that a referenced provenance file living inside
# the worktree lives under .adlc/ or .omo/evidence/ ONLY — a trust-boundary
# check preventing review "evidence" from pointing at an arbitrary,
# potentially-spoofed file elsewhere in the repo. Do not delete these three
# files as "cleanup" (see issue in PR #98's history) without also updating
# docs/examples/p5-passes.json and re-running
# packages/prosecute/test/prosecute-cli.test.mjs.
.omo/*
!.omo/evidence/
.omo/evidence/*
!.omo/evidence/p5-review.txt
!.omo/evidence/p5-prompt.txt
!.omo/evidence/p5-inputs.txt
.adlc/*
!.adlc/tickets.json
!.adlc/tickets.example.json
!.adlc/specs/
.adlc/tickets.lock

# Local env files (may contain secrets, e.g. ATTIO_API_TOKEN)
.env.local
.env*.local
